      "message": "This cause the build breakage.  This change replaced the default pach_firmware such that the only remaining artifact is the second_loader.bin file.\n\nTo reproduce the problem:\n\nWithout the second loader changes:\n\n```\n$ zmake build mtlrvpp_mchp --clobber\n$ ls build/zephyr/mtlrvpp_mchp/output\ncomponent_manifest.json  ec.bin  ec.config  zephyr.ro.elf  zephyr.ro.lst  zephyr.rw.elf  zephyr.rw.lst\n```\n\nWith the second loader changes, all the artifacts, except second_loader.bin are missing:\n\n```\n$ zmake build mtlrvpp_mchp --clobber\n$ ls build/zephyr/mtlrvpp_mchp/output\nsecond_loader_fw.bin\n```",
